{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01DvcEn1j7Ndh4a2Aw484GMU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have the story US-081:\n\n**Story US-081:** \"Add Bing Webmaster Tools verification and sitemap submission\"\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n1. Bing Webmaster Tools account created and site verified\n2. Verification via `<meta name='msvalidate.01' content='TOKEN'>` in layout.tsx metadata.verification\n3. Sitemap URL submitted to Bing\n4. Bing crawl report shows pages indexed within 7 days\n5. No crawl errors reported\n\n**Technical Notes:**\n- Use Bing Webmaster Tools at https://www.bing.com/webmasters/\n- Next.js metadata verification: `verification: { other: { 'msvalidate.01': 'YOUR_TOKEN' } }`\n- Bing can auto-import verified GSC sites\n- Submit sitemap via: Sitemaps > Submit Sitemap\n\nNow, this is a story that requires both web browser interaction (to set up Bing Webmaster Tools account and verification) AND code changes (to add the verification meta tag).\n\nThe acceptance criteria ask for:\n1. A Bing Webmaster Tools account to be created and site verified\n2. The verification token to be added to the layout.tsx metadata\n3. Sitemap submitted to Bing\n4. Bing crawl report showing pages indexed\n5. No crawl errors\n\nThis is actually asking for:\n- Real actions on the Bing Webmaster Tools website\n- Code changes to add the meta tag\n- Verification that Bing has indexed the pages\n\nLet me first understand the current project structure by exploring the codebase. I need to:\n1. Find layout.tsx to see where to add the metadata.verification\n2. Check if there's already a sitemap.xml\n3. Check the current metadata structure","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2732,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":73186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":771},"output_to