{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RCDgeMyDpNbcXy8HVefQw8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport { MetadataRoute } from \"next\";\n2\timport { blogPosts, categoryToSlug, getUniqueCategories } from \"@/data/blog/posts\";\n3\t\n4\texport default function sitemap(): MetadataRoute.Sitemap {\n5\t    const baseUrl = \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\";\n6\t    const lastModified = new Date();\n7\t\n8\t    const blogPostEntries: MetadataRoute.Sitemap = blogPosts.map((post) => ({\n9\t        url: `${baseUrl}/blog/${post.slug}`,\n10\t        lastModified: new Date(post.date),\n11\t        changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n12\t        priority: 0.7,\n13\t        images: [`${baseUrl}${post.featuredImage}`],\n14\t    }));\n15\t\n16\t    const categoryEntries: MetadataRoute.Sitemap = getUniqueCategories().map((cat) => ({\n17\t        url: `${baseUrl}/blog/category/${categoryToSlug(cat)}`,\n18\t        lastModified,\n19\t        changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n20\t        priority: 0.65,\n21\t    }));\n22\t\n23\t    return [\n24\t        {\n25\t            url: baseUrl,\n26\t            lastModified,\n27\t            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n28\t            priority: 1.0,\n29\t            images: [`${baseUrl}/images/hero-final.png`],\n30\t        },\n31\t        {\n32\t            url: `${baseUrl}/book`,\n33\t            lastModified,\n34\t            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n35\t            priority: 0.95,\n36\t        },\n37\t        {\n38\t            url: `${baseUrl}/rooms`,\n39\t            lastModified,\n40\t            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n41\t            priority: 0.9,\n42\t            images: [\n43\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-4.webp`,\n44\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-2.webp`,\n45\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-1.webp`,\n46\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-3.webp`,\n47\t            ],\n48\t        },\n49\t        {\n50\t            url: `${baseUrl}/about`,\n51\t            lastModified,\n52\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n53\t            priority: 0.8,\n54\t            images: [`${baseUrl}/images/exterior.JPG`],\n55\t        },\n56\t        {\n57\t            url: `${baseUrl}/gallery`,\n58\t            lastModified,\n59\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n60\t            priority: 0.8,\n61\t            images: [\n62\t                `${baseUrl}/images/living-room.jpeg`,\n63\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-1.webp`,\n64\t                `${baseUrl}/images/entrance.jpeg`,\n65\t                `${baseUrl}/images/exterior.JPG`,\n66\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-2.webp`,\n67\t                `${baseUrl}/images/toilet.jpg`,\n68\t                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-heater.jpg`,\n69\t                `${baseUrl}/images/sink.jpg`,\n70\t                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-3.webp`,\n71\t                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-shoes-rack.jpg`,\n72\t                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-1.webp`,\n73\t                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-2.webp`,\n74\t                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-3.webp`,\n75\t            ],\n76\t        },\n77\t        {\n78\t            url: `${baseUrl}/location`,\n79\t            lastModified,\n80\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n81\t            priority: 0.8,\n82\t        },\n83\t        {\n84\t            url: `${baseUrl}/contact`,\n85\t            lastModified,\n86\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n87\t            priority: 0.7,\n88\t        },\n89\t        {\n90\t            url: `${baseUrl}/check-in`,\n91\t            lastModified,\n92\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n93\t            priority: 0.7,\n94\t        },\n95\t        {\n96\t            url: `${baseUrl}/getting-here`,\n97\t            lastModified,\n98\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n99\t            priority: 0.8,\n100\t        },\n101\t        {\n102\t            url: `${baseUrl}/guide`,\n103\t            lastModified,\n104\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n105\t            priority: 0.6,\n106\t        },\n107\t        {\n108\t            url: `${baseUrl}/blog`,\n109\t            lastModified,\n110\t            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n111\t            priority: 0.8,\n112\t        },\n113\t        {\n114\t            url: `${baseUrl}/amenities`,\n115\t            lastModified,\n116\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n117\t            priority: 0.8,\n118\t        },\n119\t        {\n120\t            url: `${baseUrl}/visit-malaysia-2026`,\n121\t            lastModified,\n122\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n123\t            priority: 0.85,\n124\t        },\n125\t        {\n126\t            url: `${baseUrl}/visa-run`,\n127\t            lastModified,\n128\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n129\t            priority: 0.85,\n130\t        },\n131\t        {\n132\t            url: `${baseUrl}/singapore-jobs`,\n133\t            lastModified,\n134\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n135\t            priority: 0.85,\n136\t        },\n137\t        {\n138\t            url: `${baseUrl}/sitemap-html`,\n139\t            lastModified,\n140\t            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n141\t            priority: 0.3,\n142\t        },\n143\t        ...categoryEntries,\n144\t        ...blogPostEntries,\n145\t    ];\n146\t}\n147\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"3e119555-686d-4dd7-8975-fcd8d5d95709","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:57:26.557Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\sitemap.ts","content":"import { MetadataRoute } from \"next\";\nimport { blogPosts, categoryToSlug, getUniqueCategories } from \"@/data/blog/posts\";\n\nexport default function sitemap(): MetadataRoute.Sitemap {\n    const baseUrl = \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\";\n    const lastModified = new Date();\n\n    const blogPostEntries: MetadataRoute.Sitemap = blogPosts.map((post) => ({\n        url: `${baseUrl}/blog/${post.slug}`,\n        lastModified: new Date(post.date),\n        changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n        priority: 0.7,\n        images: [`${baseUrl}${post.featuredImage}`],\n    }));\n\n    const categoryEntries: MetadataRoute.Sitemap = getUniqueCategories().map((cat) => ({\n        url: `${baseUrl}/blog/category/${categoryToSlug(cat)}`,\n        lastModified,\n        changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n        priority: 0.65,\n    }));\n\n    return [\n        {\n            url: baseUrl,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n            priority: 1.0,\n            images: [`${baseUrl}/images/hero-final.png`],\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/book`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n            priority: 0.95,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/rooms`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n            priority: 0.9,\n            images: [\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-4.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-2.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-1.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-3.webp`,\n            ],\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/about`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n            images: [`${baseUrl}/images/exterior.JPG`],\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/gallery`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n            images: [\n                `${baseUrl}/images/living-room.jpeg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-1.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/entrance.jpeg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/exterior.JPG`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-2.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/toilet.jpg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-heater.jpg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/sink.jpg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/capsule-3.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-shoes-rack.jpg`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-1.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-2.webp`,\n                `${baseUrl}/images/facility-3.webp`,\n            ],\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/location`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/contact`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.7,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/check-in`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.7,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/getting-here`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/guide`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.6,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/blog`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"weekly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/amenities`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.8,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/visit-malaysia-2026`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.85,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/visa-run`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.85,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/singapore-jobs`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.85,\n        },\n        {\n            url: `${baseUrl}/sitemap-html`,\n            lastModified,\n            changeFrequency: \"monthly\",\n            priority: 0.3,\n        },\n        ...categoryEntries,\n        ...blogPostEntries,\n    ];\n}\n","numLines":147,"startLine":1,"totalLines":147}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01SMmaq1PeNQgVUQCZC5An2b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! The sitemap.ts file already exists and is generating a proper sitemap. The sitemap will be available at https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/sitemap.xml (Next.js automatically serves sitemap.ts as sitemap.xml).\n\nNow I need to understand what I can actually do with this story:\n\nThe acceptance criteria require:\n1. Bing account creation (external action - I cannot do this)\n2. Adding the verification token to layout.tsx (I CAN do this)\n3. Submitting the sitemap to Bing (external action - I cannot do this)\n4. Waiting 7 days for crawl (external - I cannot do this)\n5. Verifying no crawl errors (external - I cannot do this)\n\nIn SPIRAL's context, I should implement what I CAN (the code changes) and provide clear documentation on what needs to be done manually. However, since this is a real-world scenario where the acceptance criteria require actual external actions, let me think about this differently.\n\nActually, I realize I need to check if there's a way to do browser automation. The system has Chrome DevTools MCP tools available. But those are more for screenshots and visual verification, not for creating accounts.\n\nLet me look at this pragmatically:\n1. The code change is simple - add the Bing verification token to the metadata\n2. The external actions (account creation, submission) are manual\n\nFor a SPIRAL story, I should:\n1. Make the code change to prepare for the verification token\n2. Document the manual steps required\n3. The story will pass the CODE part but the external verification won't be testable until a human does it\n\nActually, looking at the technical notes again:\n- \"Bing can auto-import verified GSC sites — check for auto-import option first to save time\"\n\nThis suggests that since the site is already verified with Google Search Console (I saw `google: \"REPLACE_WITH_GSC_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\"` in the code), Bing might be able to auto-import the verification. So the process would be:\n\n\n1. Create Bing Webmaster Tools account\n2. Try to auto-import from Google Search Console\n3. If that doesn't work, manually add the verification token\n4. Submit sitemap\n\nBut I still can't do step 1 and part of step 4 as an AI. Let me think about what the right approach is here. The story is asking for real actions on Bing's website plus code changes. Given that I'm an autonomous agent working on a real project, I should do the code preparation by adding placeholder documentation for the Bing token and outline the manual steps clearly with a specific process.\n\nLooking at the metadata format in the code, I notice there's a `verification` object with a `google` property and a separate `other` object for additional metadata. The story specifies the Bing verification should follow Next.js metadata documentation format using `verification: { other: { 'msvalidate.01': 'YOUR_TOKEN' } }`. I need to update the structure to match this pattern rather than adding it as a sibling to the Google verification.\n\nFor what I can actually verify programmatically versus what requires manual steps: I can validate the code change compiles and the sitemap exists, but confirming Bing's crawl requires submitting to their webmaster tools. So the implementation should include the metadata structure update, environment variable configuration for the token, and document the manual submission step to Bing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2337,"cache_read_input_tokens":81087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2337},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"d40fd293-7407-431b-a48b-4e086aaa01ea"}
