{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N4cFhzMoq7c1SMuwdYRUq6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Local dev: proxy /api/chat/* to the local Rainbow AI server\n2\tRAINBOW_API_URL=http://localhost:3002\n3\t\n4\t# Google Analytics 4 — replace with real measurement ID from GA4 property settings\n5\tNEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX\n6\t\n7\t# MOTAC tourist accommodation registration number\n8\tNEXT_PUBLIC_MOTAC_REG_NUMBER=MOTAC-REG-PENDING\n9\t\n10\t# Stripe (test mode)\n11\tNEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_dummy\n12\tSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_dummy\n13\t\n14\t# Channel Manager Configuration\n15\tCHANNEL_MANAGER_PROVIDER=mock\n16\tCHANNEL_MANAGER_API_KEY=\n17\tCHANNEL_MANAGER_PROPERTY_ID=pelangi-capsule-hostel-jb\n18\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"f0cbdb3d-c49e-4738-94c3-d27d8794b6a4","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:58:02.588Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\.env.local","content":"# Local dev: proxy /api/chat/* to the local Rainbow AI server\nRAINBOW_API_URL=http://localhost:3002\n\n# Google Analytics 4 — replace with real measurement ID from GA4 property settings\nNEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX\n\n# MOTAC tourist accommodation registration number\nNEXT_PUBLIC_MOTAC_REG_NUMBER=MOTAC-REG-PENDING\n\n# Stripe (test mode)\nNEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_dummy\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_dummy\n\n# Channel Manager Configuration\nCHANNEL_MANAGER_PROVIDER=mock\nCHANNEL_MANAGER_API_KEY=\nCHANNEL_MANAGER_PROPERTY_ID=pelangi-capsule-hostel-jb\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TdBXJeUnWwxs3t3UU9Ccgn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The .env.local file doesn't have a Bing verification token configured. Now I need to plan the implementation.\n\nThe core issue is: This story requires real actions on the Bing website that I can't perform as an AI:\n1. Creating a Bing Webmaster Tools account\n2. Verifying the site with Bing\n3. Submitting the sitemap to Bing\n4. Waiting for Bing to crawl and index pages\n5. Checking for crawl errors\n\nHowever, I CAN do:\n1. Update the code to support Bing verification tokens\n2. Create comprehensive documentation for the manual steps\n3. Verify the code changes compile and work correctly\n\nGiven the nature of SPIRAL (an autonomous agent system), I should:\n1. Make the code changes to prepare for Bing verification\n2. Add clear documentation for the manual steps\n3. The story will be marked as complete when the CODE part is done, with a note that manual verification steps remain\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider the acceptance criteria. They're asking for:\n1. Account created and site verified\n2. Meta tag added\n3. Sitemap submitted\n4. Crawl report shows pages indexed\n5. No crawl errors\n\nThe KEY insight is that criteria 1, 3, 4, 5 are external actions. But criterion 2 is CODE. However, if Bing hasn't verified the site yet, I can't prove criterion 2 is working.\n\nActually, the meta tag will be IN the code regardless of whether Bing has verified it. So I CAN implement criterion 2. The meta tag is just HTML output.\n\nLet me check if I can use Chrome DevTools to verify the meta tag is present in the rendered HTML. But first, I need to understand the current state of the project - is the dev server running?\n\nActually, for a proper SPIRAL story, what I should do is:\n1. Make the code changes\n\n\n2. Verify they compile and build correctly\n3. Check that the meta tag appears in the rendered HTML using Chrome DevTools\n4. Document the process for the manual parts (account creation, sitemap submission, verification)\n5. Mark the story as passes: true once the code is verified\n\nI'll start by updating layout.tsx to add Bing verification support, then update .env.local.example to document the token, verify the TypeScript compilation succeeds, take a screenshot of the rendered HTML to confirm the meta tag is present, document the manual steps in a guide, and commit everything.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1154,"cache_read_input_tokens":86262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1154},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"800d572c-12da-4bf4-b25e-a3bd95fe058a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TdBXJeUnWwxs3t3UU9Ccgn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll implement story US-081. Let me create my diagnosis and plan first.\n\n## Current State\n- `layout.tsx` has metadata with Google verification token placeholder but no Bing verification\n- `.env.local.example` documents all configuration but no Bing token\n- `sitemap.ts` already generates proper XML sitemap at `/sitemap.xml`\n- Project uses Next.js 14+ with TypeScript\n\n## Problem Identified\nSite needs Bing Webmaster Tools verification. Story requires:\n1. Code implementation: Add Bing verification meta tag support\n2. Manual actions: Account creation, site verification, sitemap submission (external to code)\n\n## Planned Changes\n1. **layout.tsx**: Update metadata.verification to include Bing token from environment variable\n2. **.env.local.example**: Add NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN with instructions\n3. Verify build passes and meta tag renders correctly in HTML\n4. Document manual steps for Bing setup\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/app/layout.tsx\", \"site/.env.local.example\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 15\n}\n</plan>\n\nNow let me implement the changes:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1154,"cache_read_input_tokens":86262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1154},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"14685c67-4308-4f75-a527-df3c7ffaaa4d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TdBXJeUnWwxs3t3UU9Ccgn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q6Urkt2vYatdZPLSPzUoGR","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\layout.tsx","old_string":"  verification: {\n    // Replace with actual token from Google Search Console > Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: \"REPLACE_WITH_GSC_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\",\n  },","new_string":"  verification: {\n    // Google Search Console — Replace with actual token from Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN,\n    // Bing Webmaster Tools — Add token from Bing Webmaster Tools > Verify ownership > HTML tag method\n    // Once added here, Bing can auto-import GSC verification or use manual verification\n    other: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\n      ? { \"msvalidate.01\": process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN }\n      : undefined,\n  },"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1154,"cache_read_input_tokens":86262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1154},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"6e2a1b61-65e2-4305-8654-503655babab2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q6Urkt2vYatdZPLSPzUoGR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\layout.tsx has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"cde8c112-9dc0-4bf4-b7fb-6489e8e2197d","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:58:14.411Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\layout.tsx","oldString":"  verification: {\n    // Replace with actual token from Google Search Console > Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: \"REPLACE_WITH_GSC_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\",\n  },","newString":"  verification: {\n    // Google Search Console — Replace with actual token from Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN,\n    // Bing Webmaster Tools — Add token from Bing Webmaster Tools > Verify ownership > HTML tag method\n    // Once added here, Bing can auto-import GSC verification or use manual verification\n    other: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\n      ? { \"msvalidate.01\": process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN }\n      : undefined,\n  },","originalFile":"import type { Metadata } from \"next\";\nimport { Suspense } from \"react\";\nimport { Inter, Playfair_Display } from \"next/font/google\";\nimport Script from \"next/script\";\nimport { GoogleTagManager } from \"@next/third-parties/google\";\nimport \"./globals.css\";\nimport StructuredData from \"@/components/StructuredData\";\nimport { SpeedInsights } from \"@vercel/speed-insights/next\";\nimport { ChatWidget, MobileBookingBar, CookieConsent, AnalyticsProvider, BookingRecoveryBanner, MetaPixelProvider, TikTokPixelProvider, PauseAnimationsButton } from \"@/components/DynamicComponents\";\n\nconst GTM_ID = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID ?? \"\";\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"], variable: \"--font-inter\" });\nconst playfair = Playfair_Display({ subsets: [\"latin\"], variable: \"--font-playfair\" });\n\n// TODO: Create OG image at /images/og-image.jpg (1200x630px) for optimal social sharing\n// Recommended: Feature hero image with \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\" branding and \"From RM35/night\" text\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  metadataBase: new URL(\"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\"),\n  title: {\n    default: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel | Budget Accommodation in Johor Bahru\",\n    template: \"%s | Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n  },\n  description: \"Experience Japanese-style capsule accommodation in Taman Pelangi, Johor Bahru. Budget-friendly hostel from RM35/night with free WiFi, 24/7 access, hot showers, and personal lockers. Perfect base for Singapore day trips - just 30 minutes from the border.\",\n  keywords: [\n    \"capsule hostel Johor Bahru\",\n    \"budget accommodation JB\",\n    \"hostel near Singapore\",\n    \"Taman Pelangi hostel\",\n    \"cheap hostel JB\",\n    \"backpacker accommodation Malaysia\",\n    \"Japanese capsule hotel JB\",\n    \"affordable hostel Johor\",\n    \"pod hostel Malaysia\",\n    \"budget stay near Singapore border\",\n  ],\n  robots: {\n    index: true,\n    follow: true,\n    googleBot: {\n      index: true,\n      follow: true,\n      \"max-video-preview\": -1,\n      \"max-image-preview\": \"large\",\n      \"max-snippet\": -1,\n    },\n  },\n  alternates: {\n    canonical: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\",\n    languages: {\n      \"en\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\",\n      \"ms\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/ms/terma\",\n      \"x-default\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\",\n      // \"zh-CN\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/zh\", // Enable when Chinese translation is ready\n    },\n    types: {\n      \"application/rss+xml\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/feed.xml\",\n      \"application/feed+json\": \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/feed.json\",\n    },\n  },\n  openGraph: {\n    title: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel | Budget Accommodation in Johor Bahru\",\n    description: \"Japanese-style capsule accommodation from RM35/night in Taman Pelangi, JB. Free WiFi, 24/7 access, hot showers. Perfect for Singapore day trips!\",\n    url: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com\",\n    siteName: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n    locale: \"en_MY\",\n    type: \"website\",\n    images: [\n      {\n        url: \"/images/og-image.png\",\n        width: 1200,\n        height: 630,\n        alt: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel - Modern Japanese-style pods in Johor Bahru\",\n      },\n      {\n        url: \"/images/hero-main.webp\",\n        width: 1920,\n        height: 1080,\n        alt: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel interior view\",\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  twitter: {\n    card: \"summary_large_image\",\n    title: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel | From RM35/night in JB\",\n    description: \"Japanese-style capsule hostel in Taman Pelangi, Johor Bahru. Budget-friendly, modern, and just 30 min from Singapore.\",\n    images: [\"/images/og-image.png\"],\n  },\n  verification: {\n    // Replace with actual token from Google Search Console > Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: \"REPLACE_WITH_GSC_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\",\n  },\n  other: {\n    \"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\": \"black-translucent\",\n  },\n};\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: Readonly<{\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}>) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" data-scroll-behavior=\"smooth\">\n      <head>\n        {/* Consent Mode v2: deny all consent parameters before GTM loads */}\n        <Script\n          id=\"consent-mode-defaults\"\n          strategy=\"beforeInteractive\"\n          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{\n            __html: `\n              window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n              function gtag(){window.dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n              gtag('consent', 'default', {\n                ad_storage: 'denied',\n                ad_user_data: 'denied',\n                analytics_storage: 'denied',\n                ad_personalization: 'denied',\n                functionality_storage: 'denied',\n                security_storage: 'granted'\n              });`,\n          }}\n        />\n        {/* Theme color: browser toolbar matches page background in light/dark mode */}\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#fafaf9\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" />\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1c1917\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" />\n        {/* Preconnect: YouTube embed and Google Maps iframe */}\n        <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com\" />\n        <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.google.com\" />\n        {/* OpenSearch: enables browser address bar search */}\n        <link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" title=\"Pelangi Hostel\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" />\n        {/* llms.txt: AI crawler content guidance */}\n        <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/plain\" href=\"/llms.txt\" />\n        {/* JSON Feed: modern JSON alternative to RSS for blog syndication */}\n        <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/feed+json\" title=\"Pelangi Blog\" href=\"/feed.json\" />\n        {/* SVG favicon: sharp rendering on modern browsers, ICO/PNG fallbacks auto-detected from app/ */}\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n        {/* DNS-prefetch: Trip.com CDN for review/OTA images (cold path) */}\n        <link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com\" />\n        {/* Speculation Rules: prerender high-conversion pages on hover (Chrome/Edge only, ignored by others) */}\n        <script\n          type=\"speculationrules\"\n          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{\n            __html: JSON.stringify({\n              prerender: [\n                {\n                  urls: [\"/book\", \"/rooms\", \"/gallery\"],\n                  eagerness: \"moderate\",\n                },\n              ],\n            }),\n          }}\n        />\n        {/* Preload LCP hero image — srcset matches Next.js Image optimization breakpoints */}\n        <link\n          rel=\"preload\"\n          as=\"image\"\n          fetchPriority=\"high\"\n          imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-final.png&w=3840&q=75 3840w\"\n          imageSizes=\"100vw\"\n        />\n      </head>\n      <body className={`${inter.variable} ${playfair.variable} pb-16 md:pb-0`}>\n        {GTM_ID && <GoogleTagManager gtmId={GTM_ID} />}\n        <a\n          href=\"#main-content\"\n          className=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:z-100 focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:bg-amber-700 focus:text-white focus:rounded-lg focus:font-medium focus:shadow-lg\"\n        >\n          Skip to main content\n        </a>\n        <StructuredData />\n        <Suspense>{children}</Suspense>\n        <MobileBookingBar />\n        <BookingRecoveryBanner />\n        <ChatWidget />\n        <PauseAnimationsButton />\n        <CookieConsent />\n        <AnalyticsProvider />\n        <MetaPixelProvider />\n        <TikTokPixelProvider />\n        <SpeedInsights />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  );\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":88,"oldLines":8,"newStart":88,"newLines":13,"lines":["     images: [\"/images/og-image.png\"],","   },","   verification: {","-    // Replace with actual token from Google Search Console > Add Property > HTML tag method","-    google: \"REPLACE_WITH_GSC_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\",","+    // Google Search Console — Replace with actual token from Add Property > HTML tag method","+    google: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN,","+    // Bing Webmaster Tools — Add token from Bing Webmaster Tools > Verify ownership > HTML tag method","+    // Once added here, Bing can auto-import GSC verification or use manual verification","+    other: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN","+      ? { \"msvalidate.01\": process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN }","+      : undefined,","   },","   other: {","     \"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\": \"black-translucent\","]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
