{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LMmY5Sgan2PoDSu6UEmV3z","type":"tool_result","content":"88\t    images: [\"/images/og-image.png\"],\n89\t  },\n90\t  verification: {\n91\t    // Google Search Console — Replace with actual token from Add Property > HTML tag method\n92\t    google: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN,\n93\t    // Bing Webmaster Tools — Add token from Bing Webmaster Tools > Verify ownership > HTML tag method\n94\t    // Once added here, Bing can auto-import GSC verification or use manual verification\n95\t    other: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\n96\t      ? { \"msvalidate.01\": process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN }\n97\t      : undefined,\n98\t  },\n99\t  other: {\n100\t    \"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\": \"black-translucent\",\n101\t  },\n102\t};\n103\t\n104\texport default function RootLayout({\n105\t  children,\n106\t}: Readonly<{\n107\t  children: React.ReactNode;\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"f9c7cc3b-f836-4173-aa27-b6d0ae7147a8","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:59:27.990Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\layout.tsx","content":"    images: [\"/images/og-image.png\"],\n  },\n  verification: {\n    // Google Search Console — Replace with actual token from Add Property > HTML tag method\n    google: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN,\n    // Bing Webmaster Tools — Add token from Bing Webmaster Tools > Verify ownership > HTML tag method\n    // Once added here, Bing can auto-import GSC verification or use manual verification\n    other: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\n      ? { \"msvalidate.01\": process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN }\n      : undefined,\n  },\n  other: {\n    \"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\": \"black-translucent\",\n  },\n};\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: Readonly<{\n  children: React.ReactNode;","numLines":20,"startLine":88,"totalLines":192}}}
