{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01HYKh5Wj3urWqP8nd5tfNtw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0156vY6CRLjsR7upc7CZmJ5z","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/us081_notes.txt << 'EOF'\n## Iteration US-081 - Mon, Apr 14, 2026\n\nCompleted: Add Bing Webmaster Tools verification and sitemap submission (ID: US-081)\n\n### What was implemented\n- **layout.tsx metadata**: Added Bing verification token support via NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN\n  - Migrated Google token to use environment variable (NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN)\n  - Added conditional Bing meta tag: `<meta name=\"msvalidate.01\" content=\"TOKEN\">`\n  - Token is undefined/unrendered until NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN is configured\n- **.env.local.example**: Documented both Google and Bing verification tokens with setup instructions\n  - Includes link to Bing Webmaster Tools: https://www.bing.com/webmasters/\n  - Notes that Bing can auto-import verified GSC sites (saves manual step)\n- **.env.local**: Added empty token placeholders for local development\n\n### Patterns discovered\n- Next.js metadata.verification supports multiple verification methods (google, other)\n- Environment variables for verification tokens allow flexibility without committing secrets\n- Sitemap already properly implemented and serving at /sitemap.xml (79 pages in build)\n- Conditional rendering of meta tags via ternary operators prevents undefined values in HTML\n\n### Acceptance criteria status\n- [x] **Code part**: Verification meta tag structure added to layout.tsx\n- [x] **Build verification**: npm run build passes (79 static pages generated)\n- [ ] **Manual verification steps** (external actions, not code):\n  - Create Bing Webmaster Tools account at https://www.bing.com/webmasters/\n  - Add site to Bing and verify ownership (can auto-import from GSC if already verified there)\n  - Copy verification token to NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN in .env.local\n  - Deploy to production\n  - Submit sitemap URL (https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/sitemap.xml) in Bing Webmaster Tools\n  - Monitor Bing crawl report for indexed pages (typically 5-7 days)\n  - Verify no crawl errors in dashboard\n\n### Test results\n- TypeScript compilation: ✓ passes\n- Next.js build: ✓ succeeds (creates optimized production build in 17.2s)\n- Linting: ✓ no new errors introduced\n- Git commit: ✓ successful\n\n### Gotchas & Notes\n- Story has mixed code/manual components. Code part is 100% complete.\n- Once a human gets Bing verification token and adds it to .env.local + deploys, meta tag will render\n- Bing can often auto-import verification from Google Search Console (check Bing dashboard for this option first)\n- Sitemap URL is: https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/sitemap.xml (auto-generated by Next.js)\n- DuckDuckGo, Ecosia, Yahoo search are powered by Bing index (one submission covers all)\n\nEOF\ncat /tmp/us081_notes.txt","description":"Create US-081 iteration notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":96705,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":308},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64023916-cf9d-44b1-9e84-df8466e38e83","uuid":"a6f9a691-7729-425f-9313-b179bcba9676"}
